Cell["\<\
A right angle and a straight angle look the same to the test. From the centre \
45 of the grid, 65 is 2 steps along one axis, 47 2 steps along the other and \
25 2 steps back along the first:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"9d359dd4-6018-4e65-bcac-fd3ed17ca606"],

